<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίφορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἐπιφέρὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying towards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἄνεμος ἐπεγένετο τῇ φλογὶ
					ἐπίφορος ἐς [τὴν πόλιν]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.77
			</span></i> ; <i>favourable,</i> of winds. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.28.4
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφορώτατος [Ἑρμῆς]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					813
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leaning</i> or <i>prone to</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κάτω ῥέψαι</span> gloss in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς δεισιδαιμονίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.703d
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>well-suited,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.623d
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως, ἔχειν πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.3.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of documents,
				<i>applicable, relationg</i> to the matter in hand (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφέρω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.9
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				266.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1282.33
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of ground, <i>sloping,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pregnant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.103
			</span></i> ; <i>near the time of bringing forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i> ; of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
